issue.body:
Need: the exact delivered paths in assignment.json, so venue-artifacts.json can require them (it currently requires only `report/report.pdf`, named by the objective).

What for: the objective requires `report/report.pdf` plus the LaTeX source and the code next to the PDF, in the NeurIPS 2026 template. Please name:
1. the LaTeX main source (e.g. `report/report.tex`) and its inputs (bib, figure and table files);
2. the style file `report/neurips_2026.sty` (verbatim copy from venue-repo `template/neurips_2026.sty`, official files, compile-checked skeleton in `template/skeleton.tex`);
3. the code directory (experiment-repo offers `code/` as `report/code/`) and which position delivers it;
4. which position delivers the figure and table files and where (figtab-repo).

Venue decisions you may rely on (details in venue-repo `venue.md`): the 2-page cap applies to the whole PDF, references included. The mandatory NeurIPS checklist cannot fit in 2 pages and is left out of `report.pdf`, disclosed. Anonymous default mode, with no `final` or `preprint` option. Exactly one figure and one table.

Waiting on this: adding those paths to venue-artifacts.json. Nothing else is blocked.
